  -help     Show this help
  -credits  Show copyright and attribution
  -list     Playlist mode: play all PT2/PT3 on the current drive
  -loop     Loop playback: playlist in -list mode, single track otherwise
  -delay    Force delay-loop timing instead of the HBIOS hardware timer
  -msx      Force MSX standard PSG ports ($A0/$A1)
  -rc       Force RC2014 standard PSG ports ($D8/$D0)
  -coleco   Force Coleco PSG ports ($50/$51)
  -eb       Force Ed Brindley (EB) sound module ports ($68/$60)
  -tsm      Force TurboSound dual-AVR module mode (0xFF/0xFE); auto if Hi-Z

Playlist keys: Esc=quit, Space=pause, Enter=play (when paused), N/P=track,
  WASD/arrows=nav, Delx3=delete, R=redraw, l/L=loop track/playlist
